0,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
1,1,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a logical system for these spaces. The current ambiguity is just a breeding ground for future resentment.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I agree! Some people seem unhappy with how things are. We should find a way that feels fair to everyone.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"It is not just about fairness, but the physical reality. The morning rush is becoming a problem.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Precisely. We've been drifting along without a formal rule or a budget. It's time for some actual data.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Whatever we decide must be sustainable. I am concerned about who will actually manage the system long-term.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, that is a valid point. We should look into how other buildings handle this and our own history.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,Maybe we can see if the people who use their bikes every day have a different opinion?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I want to know exactly how the bikes are being moved and where the congestion happens.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"And I want to know the financial side. What is the cost of alternatives, and what is our current balance?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the administrative workload. We cannot afford a system that collapses in two months.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll check the complaint logs and the neighboring block's experience to see where things go wrong.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll look at the sticker register and the association minutes to see if there's a pattern of favoritism.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will observe the morning departures and check the rain exposure in the parking rows.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll examine the building ledger and the ward cycle park's pricing for comparison.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I'll check the treasurer's handover file and the supplier's display frame trial.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
